+#: *success*; a duration's ``or_until`` and a trigger's ``on`` are both *the
+#: source dies*; a conditional defense's ``attack`` and a mastery's
+#: ``damage_type`` are both *weapon*. Equal on the wire and correct; listed so
+#: any further collision still surfaces.
+_CONTEXT_DISTINGUISHED_VOCABULARIES = [
